17. BUSINESS RULES

- Only Super Administrators may access executive controls.
- Financial records are immutable.
- Administrative actions are permanently logged.
- Float wallet monitoring is mandatory.
- Environmental metrics are continuously updated.
- Geographic service zones are enforced.
- Corporate accountability data is maintained.
- Manual overrides are audited.



